-width: 100%; height: auto;\" title=\"728x90-Payment-plans-available-A\"/></a></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-17 dnd_area-row-6-padding dnd-section dnd_area-row-6-force-full-width-section dnd_area-row-6-background-layers dnd_area-row-6-background-color\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span dnd-column\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid-wrapper row-depth-1 row-number-18 dnd-row\">\n<div class=\"row-fluid\">\n<div class=\"span12 widget-span\">\n<div id=\"m-module_17090002865923\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-testimonials hp--light hp--sec-padding-t-sm hp--sec-padding-b-sm hp--margin-t-0 hp--margin-b-0\" style=\"background-color: transparent; \">\n<div class=\"page-center hp--relative\"><div class=\"hp-sec-testimonials__intro-sec hp-sec__intro-sec hp--align-c\"><span class=\"hp-sec__title-intro hp-sec-testimonials__title-intro\">\n        Reviews\n      </span><h2 class=\"hp-sec__title hp-heading-style--default hp-sec-testimonials__title\">What Our Clients Have To Say</h2></div></div>\n<div class=\"page-center hp--relative\">\n<div class=\"hp-sec-testimonials__slider hp-sec-testimonials__slider--pagination hp--relative\" data-autoplay=\"false\" data-autoplay-timeout=\"5000\" data-loop=\"true\" data-nav-arrows=\"true\" data-nav-bullets=\"true\" data-reverse-transition=\"false\">\n<div class=\"hp-swiper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-wrapper\">\n<div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"hp-testimonial hp-testimonial--style-2\"><div class=\"hp-rich-text hp-testimonial__quote\"><p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Google Review - ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong></p>\n<p><span>From the first time we met Kadison, we knew we made the right decision in choosing the team from Hipel Pools. Kadison listened to what we were looking for, and when he came back to see us, he provided a pool plan that was more than we could have hoped for. It was very evident this was an experienced pool company, and their wealth of knowledge with fiberglass pools was unmatched...</span></p></div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__author\"><div class=\"hp-avatar hp-avatar--valign hp-testimonial__avatar\">\n<div class=\"hp-avatar__round hp-avatar__small\">\n<img alt=\"Dolphin fiberglass pool with water features-2\" class=\"hp-avatar__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/dolphin-fiberglass-pool-with-water-features-2.jpg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1.3325740318906605; \" width=\"70\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__info\">\n<span class=\"hp-testimonial__name hp-testimonial__name--has-job-desc\">Brent R</span><span class=\"hp-testimonial__job-title\">Kitchener, ON</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"hp-testimonial hp-testimonial--style-2\"><div class=\"hp-rich-text hp-testimonial__quote\"><p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Google Review - ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong></p>\n<p><span>Hipel Pools is just a class act above the rest. From start to finish we had such an excellent experience with absolutely no regrets. I have no problem recommending them you won’t be sorry at all. Wonderful people that have such pride in workmanship. We are so pleased with the results and more pleased with the people who helped make our dreams a reality.</span></p></div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__author\"><div class=\"hp-avatar hp-avatar--valign hp-testimonial__avatar\">\n<div class=\"hp-avatar__round hp-avatar__small\">\n<img alt=\"Imagine Fiberglass Pools Illusion 35-1\" class=\"hp-avatar__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/imagine-fiberglass-pools-illusion-35-1.jpg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 0.75; \" width=\"70\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__info\">\n<span class=\"hp-testimonial__name hp-testimonial__name--has-job-desc\">John M</span><span class=\"hp-testimonial__job-title\">Wellesley, ON</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"hp-testimonial hp-testimonial--style-2\"><div class=\"hp-rich-text hp-testimonial__quote\"><p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Google Review - ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong></p>\n<p><span>I highly recommend Hipel Pools. They deliver exceptional service with a skilled and friendly crew that provides a high level of quality. Kadison, the owner, is knowledgeable and helpful and goes above and beyond demonstrating a high level of integrity. It was clear after hiring them that the quality of the job was of utmost importance. For example, we were away while our sod was installed and he dropped by on a long weekend to ensure it had been watered! Highly recommend!</span></p></div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__author\"><div class=\"hp-avatar hp-avatar--valign hp-testimonial__avatar\">\n<div class=\"hp-avatar__round hp-avatar__small\">\n<img alt=\"Hipel Pools Fiberglass Pools \" class=\"hp-avatar__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/382328497-1488571368659977-3290048347864189934-n.jpg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1.3354037267080745; \" width=\"70\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__info\">\n<span class=\"hp-testimonial__name hp-testimonial__name--has-job-desc\">Nicola B</span><span class=\"hp-testimonial__job-title\">St. Jacobs, ON</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"hp-testimonial hp-testimonial--style-2\"><div class=\"hp-rich-text hp-testimonial__quote\"><p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Google Review - ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong></p>\n<p><span>We had an amazing backyard renovation by Hipel Land &amp; Pool!</span><br/><span>Very happy with Kadison’s, and his crew’s, professionalism, and great attention to detail! Very patient with all our questions!</span><br/><span>Pool installed, with paver coping, and concrete pool deck, free-standing hot tub foundation, and a new deck!!!</span><br/><br/><span>If I had to do it again, I would definitely choose Hipel Land &amp; Pool.</span></p></div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__author\"><div class=\"hp-avatar hp-avatar--valign hp-testimonial__avatar\">\n<div class=\"hp-avatar__round hp-avatar__small\">\n<img alt=\"Dolphin Oasis II\" class=\"hp-avatar__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/dolphin-oasis-ii.jpg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1.3333333333333333; \" width=\"70\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__info\">\n<span class=\"hp-testimonial__name hp-testimonial__name--has-job-desc\">Vivian K</span><span class=\"hp-testimonial__job-title\">Waterloo, ON</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div><div class=\"swiper-slide\">\n<div class=\"hp-testimonial hp-testimonial--style-2\"><div class=\"hp-rich-text hp-testimonial__quote\"><p style=\"text-align: center; font-size: 24px;\"><strong>Google Review - ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</strong></p>\n<p><span>Everyone at Hipel Pools made my pool purchase very easy. They kept me informed of all aspects of the delivery and installation. They continue to open and close the pool and everyone is very professional. I highly recommend Hipel Pools.</span></p></div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__author\"><div class=\"hp-avatar hp-avatar--valign hp-testimonial__avatar\">\n<div class=\"hp-avatar__round hp-avatar__small\">\n<img alt=\"shutterstock_524812276 (1)\" class=\"hp-avatar__img\" data-maxretina=\"1.5\" data-sizes=\"auto\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"/files/shutterstock-524812276-1.jpg\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 1.4992503748125936; \" width=\"70\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"hp-testimonial__info\">\n<span class=\"hp-testimonial__name hp-testimonial__name--has-job-desc\">Gail L</span><span class=\"hp-testimonial__job-title\">Elmira, ON</span></div>\n</div></div>\n</div></div>\n</div><div class=\"hp--light\">\n<div class=\"swiper-pagination swiper-pagination-below\"></div>\n</div><div class=\"swiper-buttons-beside hp--light\">\n<div class=\"swiper-button-prev\"></div>\n<div class=\"swiper-button-next\"></div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\